 Just Demolish, We Deconstruct<\/div>\n        <p class=\"cap-hero-subtitle\">53 crew. 7 excavators. $85M+ in completed works. From $1.8M government demolitions to full residential house knockdowns &mdash; Coastal Demolitions is the region's first call for commercial and residential demolition, asbestos removal, and concrete grinding.<\/p>\n        <div class=\"cap-hero-ctas\">\n          <a href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/contact-us\/\" class=\"cap-btn cap-btn-urgency\">Secure Your Next-Quarter Slot<\/a>\n          <a href=\"tel:0438277589\" class=\"cap-btn cap-btn-outline\">0438 277 589<\/a>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"cap-hero-scarcity\">\n          <span class=\"cap-scarcity-dot\"><\/span>\n          Limited Commercial Openings Remaining &mdash; Next Quarter\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-video-module\">\n        <div class=\"cap-video-wrap\">\n          <video controls playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Titans-Content-Choice-2-min.jpg\">\n            <source src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/west-burleigh-commercial-demolition-optimised.mp4\" type=\"video\/mp4\">\n          <\/video>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"cap-video-label\">Watch Our Demo Reel<\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- CREDENTIAL TICKER -->\n<div class=\"cap-ticker\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <div class=\"cap-ticker-row\">\n      <div class=\"cap-ticker-item\"><span class=\"cap-ticker-icon\">&#9733;<\/span> 200+ Five-Star Reviews<\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-ticker-item\"><span class=\"cap-ticker-icon\">&#9745;<\/span> Zero WH&amp;S Infringements<\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-ticker-item\"><span class=\"cap-ticker-icon\">&#9851;<\/span> 85% Salvage Recycled<\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-ticker-item\"><span class=\"cap-ticker-icon\">&#9878;<\/span> ISO 45001 Accredited<\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- URGENCY BANNER -->\n<div class=\"cap-urgency-banner\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <div class=\"cap-urgency-text\">Currently booked out months in advance. Don't wait until next quarter &mdash; lock in your project now &rarr;<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- WHO WE ARE -->\n<div class=\"cap-section cap-beige\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <div class=\"cap-about-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"cap-label\">Who We Are<\/div>\n        <h2>The Team Behind South-East QLD's Busiest Demolition Company<\/h2>\n        <p class=\"cap-lead\">Coastal Demolitions isn't just another demolition contractor. We're the company that property developers, construction managers, government agencies and insurance companies call when the project can't afford delays, compliance issues, or excuses.<\/p>\n        <p>Our team of 53, split into dedicated commercial and residential divisions, operates with the precision of a Tier 1 contractor and the responsiveness of a family-run business. From the Sunshine Coast and Brisbane, south to Byron Bay, and inland to Toowoomba &mdash; we cover South-East QLD and Northern NSW end to end.<\/p>\n        <p>We serve large-scale property developers, insurance companies, construction and project management firms, architects, engineers, and homeowners embarking on their next build. Our client list reads like a who's who of the region's major construction projects.<\/p>\n        <p><strong>Director Daniel McKellar has 16+ years in demolition and asbestos removal. In 7 years of operating Coastal, he's built a team that has delivered $85M+ in completed demolition and asbestos removal works &mdash; and demand is only accelerating.<\/strong><\/p>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-about-image\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/coastal-demolitions-daniel-mckellar-with-family-on-site-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Daniel McKellar on site with family &mdash; Coastal Demolitions\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1439px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1439\/2560;\">\n        <div class=\"cap-about-badge\">\n          <div class=\"cap-big-num\">$85M+<\/div>\n          <div class=\"cap-badge-label\">Completed Works<\/div>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- BY THE NUMBERS -->\n<div class=\"cap-section cap-navy\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n      <div class=\"cap-label\">The Numbers Don't Lie<\/div>\n      <h2>Proven at Scale. Trusted on Site.<\/h2>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"cap-stats-grid\">\n      <div class=\"cap-stat\"><div class=\"cap-stat-num\">600+<\/div><div class=\"cap-stat-label\">Commercial Demolitions<\/div><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-stat\"><div class=\"cap-stat-num\">2,500+<\/div><div class=\"cap-stat-label\">Residential Demolitions<\/div><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-stat\"><div class=\"cap-stat-num\">4,000+<\/div><div class=\"cap-stat-label\">Asbestos Removals<\/div><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-stat\"><div class=\"cap-stat-num\">400+<\/div><div class=\"cap-stat-label\">Commercial Strip Outs<\/div><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:32px;\">\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/contact-us\/\" class=\"cap-btn cap-btn-primary\">Discuss Your Project<\/a>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- OUR SERVICES -->\n<div class=\"cap-section cap-beige\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n      <div class=\"cap-label\">What We Do<\/div>\n      <h2>Full-Spectrum Demolition &amp; Removal<\/h2>\n      <p class=\"cap-lead\" style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;\">Fully licensed for demolition, concrete grinding, Class A asbestos removal and Class B asbestos removal. Every project delivered in-house by our own crew &mdash; no subcontractors, no surprises.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"cap-services-grid\">\n      <div class=\"cap-service-card\">\n        <div class=\"cap-service-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/coastal-demolitions-burleigh-cleared-industrial-site.jpg\" alt=\"Cleared industrial site aerial &mdash; Coastal Demolitions commercial demolition\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1800px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1800\/1348;\"><\/div>\n        <div class=\"cap-service-body\">\n          <div class=\"cap-service-count\">600+<\/div>\n          <div class=\"cap-service-count-label\">Projects Delivered<\/div>\n          <h3>Commercial Demolition<\/h3>\n          <p>High-value commercial, industrial, government, airport and infrastructure demolition. Cutting-edge hydraulic machinery, heavy-duty excavators, full compliance documentation.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-service-card\">\n        <div class=\"cap-service-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/coastal-demolitions-mermaid-waters-cleared-waterfront-block.jpg\" alt=\"Cleared waterfront block at Mermaid Waters &mdash; Coastal Demolitions residential demolition\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1800px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1800\/1348;\"><\/div>\n        <div class=\"cap-service-body\">\n          <div class=\"cap-service-count\">2,500+<\/div>\n          <div class=\"cap-service-count-label\">Projects Delivered<\/div>\n          <h3>Residential Demolition<\/h3>\n          <p>Full house knockdowns, soil removal, fences, vegetation, sheds, garages, pools. Partial strip-outs for renovations. We walk you through every step.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-service-card\">\n        <div class=\"cap-service-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/coastal-demolitions-aspley-commercial-demolition-aerial.jpg\" alt=\"Large commercial aerial before knockdown &mdash; Coastal Demolitions strip outs\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1800px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1800\/1348;\"><\/div>\n        <div class=\"cap-service-body\">\n          <div class=\"cap-service-count\">400+<\/div>\n          <div class=\"cap-service-count-label\">Projects Delivered<\/div>\n          <h3>Commercial Strip Outs<\/h3>\n          <p>Comprehensive interior strip-outs with meticulous method statements, risk assessments, and transparent client communication at every stage.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-service-card\">\n        <div class=\"cap-service-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/coastal-demolitions-commercial-strip-out-interior-1.jpg\" alt=\"Coastal Demolitions team ripping out walls during interior strip-out\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1200px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1200\/899;\"><\/div>\n        <div class=\"cap-service-body\">\n          <div class=\"cap-service-count\">4,000+<\/div>\n          <div class=\"cap-service-count-label\">Projects Delivered<\/div>\n          <h3>Asbestos Removal<\/h3>\n          <p>Class A &amp; B licensed. Commercial and residential buildings, friable burn-down demolitions, asset remediation. Zero WH&amp;S infringements.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-service-card\">\n        <div class=\"cap-service-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/coastal-demolitions-culture-earthworks-excavator-land-clearing.jpg\" alt=\"Excavator completing earthworks and land clearing &mdash; Coastal Demolitions\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1800px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1800\/1348;\"><\/div>\n        <div class=\"cap-service-body\">\n          <h3>Earthworks &amp; Excavation<\/h3>\n          <p>Site preparation, cut and fill, bulk earthworks. Our fleet runs from 1.5T to 39T excavators &mdash; we match the machine to the job.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-service-card\">\n        <div class=\"cap-service-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/Concrete-Grinding.jpg\" alt=\"Concrete grinding services\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1600px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1600\/1198;\"><\/div>\n        <div class=\"cap-service-body\">\n          <h3>Concrete Grinding<\/h3>\n          <p>Surface preparation, levelling and removal with all-size walk-behind grinders. Soil remediation services also available.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- FLEET & CAPABILITY -->\n<div class=\"cap-section cap-light-grey\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:48px;\">\n      <div class=\"cap-label\">Equipment &amp; Reach<\/div>\n      <h2>We Own Every Machine. We Run Every Crew.<\/h2>\n      <p class=\"cap-lead\">No subcontractors. No borrowed equipment. Every truck, excavator, grinder and trailer in our fleet is ours &mdash; maintained, crewed, and ready to mobilise.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"cap-fleet-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <ul class=\"cap-fleet-list\">\n          <li class=\"cap-fleet-item\"><span class=\"cap-fleet-icon\">7<\/span><span><strong>Excavators<\/strong> &mdash; 1.5 tonne to 39 tonne<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-fleet-item\"><span class=\"cap-fleet-icon\">4<\/span><span><strong>Hook bin trucks<\/strong> &mdash; rotating 15 bins from 15m&sup3; to 35m&sup3;<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-fleet-item\"><span class=\"cap-fleet-icon\">4<\/span><span><strong>Prime movers<\/strong> &mdash; towing 20m&sup3; to 40m&sup3; trailers<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-fleet-item\"><span class=\"cap-fleet-icon\">1<\/span><span><strong>Low loader float<\/strong> &mdash; for all machine transport<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-fleet-item\"><span class=\"cap-fleet-icon\">+<\/span><span><strong>Semi tippers, bobcats, all-size walk-behind grinders<\/strong> &mdash; plus every attachment needed to deliver any project we take on<\/span><\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-fleet-coverage\">\n        <h3>Service Region<\/h3>\n        <p>Operating across South-East Queensland and Northern NSW:<\/p>\n        <div class=\"cap-region-tags\">\n          <span class=\"cap-region-tag\">Gold Coast<\/span>\n          <span class=\"cap-region-tag\">Brisbane<\/span>\n          <span class=\"cap-region-tag\">Logan<\/span>\n          <span class=\"cap-region-tag\">Sunshine Coast<\/span>\n          <span class=\"cap-region-tag\">Toowoomba<\/span>\n          <span class=\"cap-region-tag\">Byron Bay<\/span>\n          <span class=\"cap-region-tag\">Northern Rivers<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- QUOTE -->\n<div class=\"cap-section cap-blue cap-quote\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <blockquote>&ldquo;Our reputation was built on unwavering safety procedures, rigid process and zero shortcuts. When we take on a project, we manage everything &mdash; planning, permits, execution, and final clean-up. That's why we're booked months ahead.&rdquo;<\/blockquote>\n    <cite>&mdash; Daniel McKellar, Managing Director<\/cite>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- ASBESTOS PROCESS -->\n<div class=\"cap-section cap-white\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n      <div class=\"cap-label\">Class A &amp; B Licensed<\/div>\n      <h2>Asbestos Testing &amp; Removal &mdash; Our 8-Step Process<\/h2>\n      <p class=\"cap-lead\" style=\"max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;\">As an approved Class A &amp; B Asbestos Removal company, we perform asbestos-related work across commercial and residential buildings, friable burn-down demolitions, and commercial asset remediation. Every step documented. Every clearance certified.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"cap-process-grid\">\n      <div class=\"cap-process-step\"><div class=\"cap-step-num\">01<\/div><h4>Inspection &amp; Testing<\/h4><p>Licensed inspector examines the building. Non-friable and friable samples lab-tested to confirm asbestos content.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-process-step\"><div class=\"cap-step-num\">02<\/div><h4>Planning &amp; Permits<\/h4><p>Removal plan created to regulation. Equipment, disposal, worker protection defined. All permits obtained from authorities.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-process-step\"><div class=\"cap-step-num\">03<\/div><h4>Site Preparation<\/h4><p>Work area sealed &mdash; plastic sheeting, negative air pressure. HVAC isolated. Restricted access zones established.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-process-step\"><div class=\"cap-step-num\">04<\/div><h4>Worker Protection<\/h4><p>Full PPE: disposable coveralls, gloves, boots, P100 respirators. Decontamination unit for safe entry\/exit.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-process-step\"><div class=\"cap-step-num\">05<\/div><h4>Wet Removal<\/h4><p>ACM materials wet-sprayed. Removed carefully into leak-tight, labelled containers or double-bagged immediately.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-process-step\"><div class=\"cap-step-num\">06<\/div><h4>Cleanup &amp; Decon<\/h4><p>HEPA-vacuumed, wet-wiped. All tools cleaned. Waste sealed, labelled, transported to approved hazardous waste facility.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-process-step\"><div class=\"cap-step-num\">07<\/div><h4>Air Clearance Testing<\/h4><p>Certified inspector performs air monitoring. Once cleared, containment barriers safely removed.<\/p><\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-process-step\"><div class=\"cap-step-num\">08<\/div><h4>Documentation<\/h4><p>Waste manifests, air clearance results, work logs and certifications &mdash; full project record delivered to you.<\/p><\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- MEET THE TEAM -->\n<div class=\"cap-section cap-navy\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <div class=\"cap-team-header\">\n      <div class=\"cap-label\">Our People<\/div>\n      <h2>Meet The Leadership Team<\/h2>\n      <p>Locally owned, family-operated, and backed by 53 qualified professionals. Based in Burleigh Heads on the Gold Coast, our leadership team brings decades of combined experience across demolition, project management, estimating, and operations.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"cap-leadership-grid\">\n      <div class=\"cap-leader\">\n        <div class=\"cap-leader-photo\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/coastal-demolitions-daniel-mckellar-managing-director.jpg\" alt=\"Daniel McKellar, Managing Director &mdash; Coastal Demolitions\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"l