  <div class=\"cap-project-body\">\n          <div class=\"cap-project-client\">Luxury Residential<\/div>\n          <h3>74 Hedges Avenue &amp; 6 Hilda Street, Mermaid Beach<\/h3>\n          <div class=\"cap-project-meta\"><span><strong>Scope:<\/strong> Dual-site luxury residential demolition<\/span><\/div>\n          <p>Two neighbouring sites on Gold Coast's most prestigious beachfront strip. Premium residential knockdown delivered clean and on schedule &mdash; full site clearance ready for luxury rebuild.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"cap-project\">\n        <div class=\"cap-project-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/coastal-demolitions-palm-beach-house-frame-demolition.jpg\" alt=\"Excavator pushing over house frame during Palm Beach demolition &mdash; Coastal Demolitions\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" class=\"lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1800px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1800\/1012;\"><\/div>\n        <div class=\"cap-project-body\">\n          <div class=\"cap-project-client\">Developer<\/div>\n          <h3>1409&ndash;1415 Gold Coast Highway, Palm Beach<\/h3>\n          <div class=\"cap-project-meta\"><span><strong>Value:<\/strong> $1,490,000<\/span><\/div>\n          <p>900 sq\/m apartment demolition, 4 levels. 1,500 tonnes of asbestos-contaminated soil removed and disposed under EPA licence.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:32px;\">\n      <a href=\"https:\/\/coastaldemolitions.com\/projects\/\" class=\"cap-btn cap-btn-dark\">View All Projects<\/a>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<!-- CREDENTIALS & LICENCES -->\n<div class=\"cap-section cap-navy\">\n  <div class=\"cap-container\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:48px;\">\n      <div class=\"cap-label\">Trust &amp; Compliance<\/div>\n      <h2>The Credentials That Set Us Apart<\/h2>\n      <p><strong style=\"color:#fff;\">ISO 45001:2018<\/strong> Occupational Health &amp; Safety Management Systems Accredited. Zero WH&amp;S improvement notices or infringements in approximately 5 years of asbestos work. 85% demolition salvage recycled. These aren't marketing claims &mdash; they're audited, documented, and verifiable.<\/p>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"cap-creds-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Licences &amp; Accreditations<\/h3>\n        <ul class=\"cap-cred-list\">\n          <li class=\"cap-cred-item\"><span class=\"cap-cred-check\">&#10003;<\/span><span>ISO 45001:2018 OH&amp;S Management Systems<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-cred-item\"><span class=\"cap-cred-check\">&#10003;<\/span><span>Class A Asbestos Removal Licence<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-cred-item\"><span class=\"cap-cred-check\">&#10003;<\/span><span>Class B Asbestos Removal Licence<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-cred-item\"><span class=\"cap-cred-check\">&#10003;<\/span><span>Environmental Protection Authority (EPA) Transport Licence<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-cred-item\"><span class=\"cap-cred-check\">&#10003;<\/span><span>Nationally Accredited Plant Operator<\/span><\/li>\n        <\/ul>\n      <\/div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">Insurance &amp; Compliance<\/h3>\n        <ul class=\"cap-cred-list\">\n          <li class=\"cap-cred-item\"><span class=\"cap-cred-check\">&#10003;<\/span><span>Public Liability Insurance<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-cred-item\"><span class=\"cap-cred-check\">&#10003;<\/span><span>Asbestos Liability Cover<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-cred-item\"><span class=\"cap-cred-check\">&#10003;<\/span><span>REG Equipment Class &mdash; LE, LL, LS<\/span><\/li>\n          <li class=\"cap-cred-item\"><span class=\"cap-cred-check\">&#10003;<\/span><span>High R